          "chapter": 53,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "Every one of them has gone back. They have become filthy together. There is no one who does good, no, not one.",
      "ko": "각기 물러가 함께 더러운 자가 되고 선을 행하는 자 없으니 하나도 없도다",
      "source_text_hash": "33a004d49eb4f9f622d33638050e3be967f3a9244c1f06c4d914463a4781a0d7",
      "translation_text_hash": "292281391089760ea30b562f94bda0e5dcf74ff7f94f7acc3edbd7b3b34ae993",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "각기 물러가 함께 더러운 자가 되고 선을 행하는 자 없으니 하나도 없도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "292281391089760ea30b562f94bda0e5dcf74ff7f94f7acc3edbd7b3b34ae993"
      ]
    },
